{"uid":"1a015338c866ace9","name":"Failed v2 RFC callback for invalid RTP transition - DS-12N negative compliant","fullName":"functional-tests.tests.callbacks_v2.test_RTP_callback_DS_12N_negative#test_fail_send_rfc_callback_invalid_transition_DS_12N_negative_compliant","historyId":"ad9ae932d357f491590118d811784ae3","time":{"start":1793976396154,"stop":1793976401864,"duration":5710},"description":"\nTest v2 RFC callback DS12N with RJCR status applied twice on the same RTP.\n\nFlow:\n1. Activate payer\n2. Send an RTP via GPD message v2 (CREATE VALID)\n3. Cancel the RTP via GPD message v2 (DELETE) -> RTP to RFC_SENT\n4. Send DS12N callback with CxlStsId RJCR (Rejected Cancellation Request) -> RTP to CANCELLED_REJECTED\n5. Send the same DS12N RJCR callback again on the already transitioned RTP\n6. Verify the second callback is rejected (400) since the transition is no longer valid\n7. Verify RTP status remains CANCELLED_REJECTED\n","descriptionHtml":"<p>Test v2 RFC callback DS12N with RJCR status applied twice on the same RTP.</p>\n<p>Flow:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Activate payer</li>\n<li>Send an RTP via GPD message v2 (CREATE VALID)</li>\n<li>Cancel the RTP via GPD message v2 (DELETE) -&gt; RTP to RFC_SENT</li>\n<li>Send DS12N callback with CxlStsId RJCR (Rejected Cancellation Request) -&gt; RTP to CANCELLED_REJECTED</li>\n<li>Send the same DS12N RJCR callback again on the already transitioned RTP</li>\n<li>Verify the second callback is rejected (400) since the transition is no longer valid</li>\n<li>Verify RTP status remains CANCELLED_REJECTED</li>\n</ol>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"newBroken":false,"newPassed":false,"retriesCount":0,"retriesStatusChange":false,"beforeStages":[{"name":"_session_faker","time":{"start":1793975228126,"stop":1793975228185,"duration":59},"status":"passed","steps":[],"attachments":[],"parameters":[],"stepsCount":0,"shouldDisplayMessage":false,"attachmentsCount":0,"hasContent":false,"attachmentStep":false},{"name":"rtp_consum